Subject\_term: Energy grids and networks;Energy modelling;Energy policy;Energy supply and demand;Renewable energy
Subject\_term\_id: energy-grids-and-networks;energy-modelling;energy-policy;energy-supply-and-demand;renewable-energy},
	keywords = {Energy grids and networks, Energy modelling, Energy policy, Energy supply and demand, Renewable energy},
