	abstract = {ENTSO-E has published the PECD dataset with the Mid-term Adequacy Forecast (MAF) 2019: https://www.entsoe.eu/outlooks/midterm/\#download The downloadable archive contains 3 large Microsoft Excel ({\textasciitilde}350 MB each). Each file contains the hourly data for all the considered weather years (1982-2016) for all the MAF regions (grouped in tabs). Here we provide the same data but in a more open and user-friendly format. Single files Data saved in CSV and Feather format (using R package feather 0.35). Each file contains the hourly data in a wide tabular format with area, day, month, hour and year (1982-2016). The files are: PECD-MAF2019-wide-PV.csv (and .feather) PECD-MAF2019-wide-WindOffshore.csv (and .feather) PECD-MAF2019-wide-WindOnshore.csv (and .feather) Split by year We provide here three archives each one containing a file per year. The files are: PECD-MAF2019-wide-PV.single\_years.tar.bz2 PECD-MAF2019-wide-WindOffShore.single\_years.tar.bz2 PECD-MAF2019-wide-WindOnshore.single\_years.tar.bz2},
